# ==============================================================================
# RescuOS - Environment Architecture Overview
# ==============================================================================
# Environment files are split individually into Frontend and Backend:
#
# 1. FRONTEND:
#    - Target File: .env (or .env.frontend)
#    - Template:    .env.frontend.example
#    - Variables:
#        VITE_PORT=5173
#        VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:5000/api/v1
#        VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
#        VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your_anon_key_here
#
# 2. BACKEND:
#    - Target File: server/.env (or .env.backend)
#    - Template:    server/.env.example (or .env.backend.example)
#    - Variables:
#        PORT=5000
#        NODE_ENV=development
#        FRONTEND_URL=http://localhost:5173
#        SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
#        SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=your_service_role_key_here
#        SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your_anon_key_here
#        GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here
# ==============================================================================
